an class=\"slash\">/</span><span>Speed test</span></div><div class=\"header-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"command-trigger\" aria-label=\"Open command palette\" title=\"Find any tool (Ctrl K)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><kbd>Ctrl K</kbd></button><span class=\"header-note\">Small tools. Everyday useful.</span><button class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark theme\" title=\"Switch to dark theme\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main id=\"main\"><div class=\"page-transition\"><div class=\"page\"><a class=\"back-link\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>All tools</a><div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg></span><div><h1>Speed test</h1><p>A fuller picture of speed and responsiveness.</p></div></div><div class=\"speed-layout\"><div><section class=\"test-panel\" aria-label=\"Connection speed test\"><div class=\"panel-top\"><span><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Connection test</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-earth\"><path d=\"M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54\"></path><path d=\"M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17\"></path><path d=\"M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg>Cloudflare</span></div><div class=\"speed-gauge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 280 175\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"_R_4nav5ubt5b_\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"var(--speed-low)\"></stop><stop offset=\"33%\" stop-color=\"var(--speed-medium)\"></stop><stop offset=\"66%\" stop-color=\"var(--speed-good)\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"var(--speed-fast)\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><path d=\"M25 145 A115 115 0 0 1 255 145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" stroke-width=\"13\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M25 145 A115 115 0 0 1 255 145\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#_R_4nav5ubt5b_)\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(0 140 145)\"></line><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"145\" r=\"6\" fill=\"var(--text)\"></circle><text x=\"17\" y=\"171\" fill=\"var(--text-dim)\" font-size=\"11\">0</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"171\" fill=\"var(--text-dim)\" font-size=\"11\">300+</text></svg><div class=\"speed-number\"><strong>0.0</strong><span>Mbps <!-- -->download</span><small>Ready to measure</small></div></div><div class=\"phase\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Ready when you are</div><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg>Ping</div><strong>Pending</strong><small>No final value yet</small></div><div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>Download</div><strong>Pending</strong><small>No final value yet</small></div><div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-label\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path></svg>Upload</div><strong>Pending</strong><small>No final value yet</small></div></div><button class=\"primary-button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg> <!-- -->Start test</button><p class=\"test-note\">Usually takes 30–60 seconds; slow connections may take longer.<br/>Uses real traffic—hundreds of MB or more on fast connections. Hiding this tab pauses the test; returning resumes it.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-dim\">An 80 Mbps plan can sometimes measure above 80; we do not cap results to a plan. For a fair comparison, use Ethernet or strong Wi-Fi, stop other downloads, and repeat on the same device. No browser test can guarantee an exact speed.</p></section><section class=\"history\"><div class=\"history-heading\"><h2>Recent results</h2><span>On this device</span></div><p class=\"history-empty\">Your completed tests will appear here.</p></section></div><aside class=\"info-panel\"><h2>Behind the numbers</h2><div class=\"info-item\"><h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>Download</h3><p>How quickly data reaches your device. Higher speeds help with streaming and large files.</p></div><div class=\"info-item\"><h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path></svg>Upload</h3><p>How quickly you send data. Useful for video calls, sharing files, and cloud backups.</p></div><div class=\"info-item\"><h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg>Ping</h3><p>Median of ten warmed HTTP probes. Resource Timing excludes connection setup when available; server processing still contributes. This is not ICMP ping.</p></div><p class=\"server-note\">Measured through Cloudflare’s public endpoints using four concurrent streams, a two-second warm-up and three four-second rounds per direction. The final speed is the median, not the peak. This is browser HTTP throughput to one provider, not a guaranteed ISP line rate.</p></aside></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer><span>Made for the everyday.</span><span>Simple by design <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></footer></div></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2z4ulqfwq0bbc.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[28739,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"Providers\\\"]\\n3:I[138,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"Shell\\\"]\\n4:I[68048,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[95454,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[55017,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[75940,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1_gylfiku9qw7.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[44074,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n9:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nc:I[44074,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[44074,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/41ob2gfonvw_-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2ov9q0bq6u9n2.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n10:I[8965